{"person":"person:canon:duanyu","as_name":"段郎","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:muwanqing"],"ch":[7,7],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[7,9,19,25,"e6ce5002d2c5631d"],[7,59,140,147,"5460e05c5090146e"]],"note":"本回木婉清口中的段郎一律指段誉；登记表里这个称呼同时挂在他父亲段正淳名下，需按本回消歧"}
{"person":"person:canon:daobaifeng","as_name":"段夫人","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["*"],"ch":[7,7],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[7,34,0,9,"e02b039698665894"]],"note":"本回的段夫人指刀白凤；该称呼在登记表里也指别人，需按本回消歧"}
{"person":"person:canon:daobaifeng","as_name":"玉虚散人","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":"place:canon:zhennanwangfu","believed_by":["person:canon:muwanqing"],"ch":[7,7],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[7,4,76,82,"9ceb5febbe0eaf96"],[7,4,116,122,"9ceb5febbe0eaf96"]],"note":"席间木婉清只知她是玉虚散人，听到她手背红记后才发觉是师父要杀的刀白凤，随即行刺"}
{"person":"person:canon:qinhongmian","as_name":"幽谷客","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:muwanqing"],"ch":[7,7],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[7,30,104,120,"6999ebbc565c2756"]],"note":"木婉清只知师父的这个外号，不知其真名；段正淳听后便猜到是秦红棉，随后点破"}
{"person":"person:canon:duanyanqing","as_name":"青袍客","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:muwanqing","person:canon:duanyu"],"ch":[7,7],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[7,184,6,20,"9f10d0de7fffbddb"],[7,187,23,33,"17e71a3e2b68d4a2"]],"note":"段誉与木婉清只见到这个青袍老者，他不肯透露来历，直到末尾才自称是四大恶人里的头一位；回内二人并不知其真名"}
